  drop1 {2..13}: M(A)=2/15=0.13333 (>1/14? True)
    widest safe arc W(A)=1/28=0.035714;  tooth t(m)=1/(98m)
    => M0(A)=floor(1/(98 W))+1 = 1  (m>=M0 : W>t(m) => M(S)>=1/14 automatic)
