       m= 1: W>t? True  (t=0.01020) | M(S)=0.12500>=1/14? True
       m= 2: W>t? True  (t=0.00510) | M(S)=0.13333>=1/14? True
       m= 3: W>t? True  (t=0.00340) | M(S)=0.13333>=1/14? True
    lemma holds (predicted-safe => actually safe) for all tested m: True

