CONSEQUENCE: the infinite m-direction is discharged RIGOROUSLY for each core:
  m>=M0(A): automatic by the arc-width lemma (W(A) computed from A alone).
  m<M0(A):  a FINITE check. Residual LRC(14) = (finitely many cores)x(m<M0).
